@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-69 - Send Chat Message

actor "Guest" as Actor
boundary "Chat Widget / Admin Chat UI" as FE
control "ChatController" as API
control "ChatService" as Service
database "MongoDB: chatConversations" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-69
FE -> API: POST /chat/conversations/:id/messages
API -> Service: Execute Send Chat Message
Service -> DB: Read/write chatConversations
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Tin nhắn được gửi

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Chat conversation đang mở
Post: Tin nhắn được gửi
Main flow:
1. User/guest nhập tin nhắn vào chat widget
2. User bấm Send
3. System gọi API POST /chat/conversations/:id/messages
4. System push message vào messages[]
5. System tăng unreadForManager
6. Tin nhắn hiển thị trong chat widget
end note
@enduml
